{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"862869528059576360","content":"As you all dive down following Prosser, you can eventually make out the form of a large squid thrashing about. Several figures who look to be large otters are attacking it, and there is a bloody cloud in the water. As you all get into positions several of the otter-like figures notice you and turn. Please roll initiative and place yourself on the battle maps (you must start at least 30 feet away from Champ. The maps are on top of each other from left to right (leftmost is highest) and there are 15 feet between each map. The uppermost map is 30 feet below the surface, meaning for characters with 30 ms it will take one turn of dashing to get from the top level to the surface if you need to take a breath. 12 seconds of being underwater have elapsed. If you sink below the lowest level you will continue to sink for a while, falling further and further below the bottom level. The left side of each map is where Champ is.","created_at":"2021-07-17T02:00:45.490000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865775000707399710","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
